<title>UK: LME copper hovers above $2,500, others steady.</title>
<headline>LME copper hovers above $2,500, others steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Firm, hovers above $2,500. Cash/threes wider at $78/$83 backwardation. Stocks down by 1,125 tonnes.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Little changed, straddling $1,650 technical level.</p>
<p>Stocks fall by 2,400 tonnes.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Holds Tuesday's weaker levels around $7,700.</p>
<p>LEAD - Touch firmer, in range. ZINC/TIN - Little changed.</p>
</text>
